				<div class="col-lg-8">
					<article class="am-privacy-content">
						<section id="introduction"><span class="am-privacy-number">01</span><div><h2>Introduction</h2><p>At Al-Asim Quran, we value and respect the privacy of our students, parents, visitors and users. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, protect and manage your personal information when you use our website and online educational services.</p></div></section>
						<section id="information"><span class="am-privacy-number">02</span><div><h2>Information We Collect</h2><p>We may collect personal information including:</p><ul><li>Full name</li><li>Email address</li><li>Phone number</li><li>WhatsApp number</li><li>Country of residence</li><li>Student information</li><li>Course preferences</li><li>Communication records</li></ul><p>We may also collect non-personal information such as browser type, device information and website usage statistics to improve our services.</p></div></section>
						<section id="use"><span class="am-privacy-number">03</span><div><h2>How We Use Your Information</h2><p>The information collected may be used to:</p><ul><li>Process registrations and inquiries</li><li>Schedule classes and educational services</li><li>Communicate with students and parents</li><li>Provide customer support</li><li>Improve our website and learning programs</li><li>Send important updates and notifications</li></ul></div></section>
						<section id="protection"><span class="am-privacy-number">04</span><div><h2>Information Protection</h2><p>We implement appropriate security measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration or misuse. However, no online system can guarantee complete security.</p></div></section>
						<section id="sharing"><span class="am-privacy-number">05</span><div><h2>Information Sharing</h2><p>Al-Asim Quran does not sell, rent or trade your personal information to third parties. Information may only be shared when required by law or when necessary to provide our educational services.</p></div></section>
						<section id="cookies"><span class="am-privacy-number">06</span><div><h2>Cookies Policy</h2><p>Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to improve user experience, analyze website performance and enhance website functionality. Users may choose to disable cookies through their browser settings.</p></div></section>
						<section id="third-party"><span class="am-privacy-number">07</span><div><h2>Third-Party Services</h2><p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites or services. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of external websites.</p></div></section>
						<section id="children"><span class="am-privacy-number">08</span><div><h2>Children's Privacy</h2><p>We are committed to protecting the privacy of children. Parents or guardians are encouraged to supervise their children's online activities and communications.</p></div></section>
						<section id="rights"><span class="am-privacy-number">09</span><div><h2>Your Rights</h2><p>You may request access to, correction of or deletion of your personal information by contacting us directly. We will make reasonable efforts to respond to such requests in accordance with applicable laws.</p></div></section>
						<section id="updates"><span class="am-privacy-number">10</span><div><h2>Updates to This Policy</h2><p>Al-Asim Quran reserves the right to update or modify this Privacy Policy at any time. Any changes will be posted on this page with immediate effect.</p></div></section>
						<section id="contact"><span class="am-privacy-number">11</span><div><h2>Contact Us</h2><p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or the handling of your information, please contact us through our website, email or support channels.</p><a class="am-privacy-contact" href="mailto:alasimquran@gmail.com"><i class="fa-regular fa-envelope"></i> alasimquran@gmail.com</a></div></section>
